  "summary": "<p>Last week, President Donald J. Trump removed CNN, MS NOW, and Politico from the White House grounds after years of false reporting. The First Amendment protects their right to publish; it does not entitle them to a hard pass, briefing room seat, or place in the press pool. Access changes are nothing new. What is [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/09/white-house-access-is-a-privilege-not-a-right/\">White House Access Is a Privilege — Not a Right</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
